			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@AmeliaBR\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>AmeliaBR</span></a></span> yeah! `npm:extract-colors` on favicon via <a href=\"https://www.11ty.dev/docs/services/opengraph/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">11ty.dev/docs/services/opengra</span><span class=\"invisible\">ph/</span></a> and then sorted oklch by lightness and chroma (descending)</p><p>…I should write a blog post.</p>",
