			"date": "2025-02-27T17:27:02.980Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fosstodon.org/@uncenter\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>uncenter</span></a></span> yeah, I get it — it isn’t an Eleventy plugin per-say but I suppose in my head I was choosing between @11ty/ or <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span>/ and the former made more sense with the fetch and -img use internally.</p><p>It’s a gray area — should is-land be under @11ty/?</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
