			"date": "2025-02-27T17:31:17.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fosstodon.org/@eleventy\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>eleventy</span></a></span> OMG, I was *just* migrating my site to 11ty v3 + the v6 image plugin this morning and starting to eye Sharp to do something like this!</p>",
