				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-27T17:55:19.500Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fosstodon.org/@uncenter\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>uncenter</span></a></span> Whether or not something is tightly coupled to Eleventy core isn’t really what I’d consider weighted into whether or not something is namespaced under @11ty/. What do you think about `eleventy-fetch`?</p>",
