			},
			"date": "2025-02-28T15:31:49.496Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@chriskirknielsen\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>chriskirknielsen</span></a></span> it’s not really magic, just a quick sort by oklch Lightness and Chroma — wrote it up here: <a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/114082206353649121\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachle</span><span class=\"invisible\">at/114082206353649121</span></a></p><p>You could make a fancy multicolor gradient border from all of the colors it finds but I didn’t!</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
